<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;You can't call [doc://keys] on an array so that's not going to do anything useful.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As of 5.12 (2010), &lt;c&gt;keys @array&lt;/c&gt; returns the indicies of the array.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$ perl -wMstrict -le 'my @x=qw/a b c d/; print for keys @x'
0
1
2
3
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But yeah, in this context it's not useful.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
